            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# ConverterKing 0.2.0

- WebP conversion now uses a bundled encoder and works even when macOS has no system WebP encoder.
- Video to GIF is now available with trimming, frame-rate, size and looping controls.
- Image and video compression are now available.
- New brighter ConverterKing app icon.
- Conversion reliability, progress and batch-safety improvements.
]]></description>
